Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Command+Space toggles Chinese/English (global event
 tap)

- handle() intercepts pure Command+Space and toggles ascii_mode
- global CGEventTap captures Command+Space even in apps (e.g. terminals)
  that bypass the input method; needs Accessibility permission
- track the focused controller via SquirrelInputController.current
